  "notes": "Limited theatrical-release variant of Starter Box, sold exclusively at cinemas showing the first Yu-Gi-Oh! movie; released 12 days before the general Starter Box. Roster overlaps but is not identical to the general release: 5 cards (Trial of Nightmare, The 13th Grave, Dark King of the Abyss, Turtle Tiger, Aqua Madoor) differ from the general Starter Box's 5 exclusive cards (Kageningen, Spiked Snail, Genin, Rock Ogre Grotto #2, King Fog)."
